# Allowlist: the build context holds only what the Dockerfile copies.
# Secrets (.env, *.env.yaml), data/raw, docs, tests, eval, reference and dev clutter are never sent.
*
!Dockerfile
!requirements.txt
!app/
!ingest/
!data/papers.db
!data/chroma_index/
# Re-exclude clutter inside allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.env
**/.env.*
